{"4302250": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Blockenstein", "steam_appid": 4302250, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Blockenstein</strong> is an action roguelike where you battle through endless dungeon towers, fighting hordes of enemies and powerful bosses.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Choose Your Class</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick from four unique classes, each with distinct playstyles:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Warrior - Heavy melee combat with sweeping attacks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mage - Ranged magic with devastating spells</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rogue - Fast strikes and deadly precision</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cleric - Holy power that heals and smites</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Specialize Your Build</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At level 5, unlock subclass specializations that transform your abilities:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Warriors become Tanks or Fighters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mages master Fire or Ice</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rogues choose Thief or Duelist</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clerics follow the path of Priest or Paladin</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Collect Powerful Gear</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find equipment ranging from Common to Legendary. Helms, armor, weapons, and accessories each provide unique bonuses and visual upgrades to your character.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Climb the Tower</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle through procedurally generated rooms</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face increasingly difficult enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat massive bosses at the top of each tower</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How high can you climb?</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Permanent Progression</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your meta-level persists between runs. Unlock talents, earn skill points, and grow stronger with each attempt.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Blockenstein</strong> is an action roguelike where you battle through endless dungeon towers, fighting hordes of enemies and powerful bosses.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Choose Your Class</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick from four unique classes, each with distinct playstyles:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Warrior - Heavy melee combat with sweeping attacks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mage - Ranged magic with devastating spells</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rogue - Fast strikes and deadly precision</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cleric - Holy power that heals and smites</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Specialize Your Build</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At level 5, unlock subclass specializations that transform your abilities:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Warriors become Tanks or Fighters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mages master Fire or Ice</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rogues choose Thief or Duelist</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clerics follow the path of Priest or Paladin</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Collect Powerful Gear</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find equipment ranging from Common to Legendary. Helms, armor, weapons, and accessories each provide unique bonuses and visual upgrades to your character.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Climb the Tower</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle through procedurally generated rooms</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face increasingly difficult enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat massive bosses at the top of each tower</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How high can you climb?</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Permanent Progression</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your meta-level persists between runs. Unlock talents, earn skill points, and grow stronger with each attempt.</p>", "short_description": "Blockenstein is a roguelike dungeon crawler where you battle through endless towers as Warrior, Mage, Rogue, or Cleric. Level up, unlock equipment, and master your class to climb higher!", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4302250/5e7ca2e8dbd233ce4db73396c8e42c2a35a08305/header.jpg?t=1770309464", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4302250/00aa356eb73379a82d2a76e42a048e72781a4969/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770309464", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4302250/00aa356eb73379a82d2a76e42a048e72781a4969/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770309464", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3 / AMD Ryzen 3 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> OpenGL 3.3 / Vulkan 1.0 compatible GPU<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong>  DirectX compatible sound card<br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> Not supported<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Keyboard and mouse recommended</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Vandazel"], "publishers": ["Vandazel"], "price_overview": {"currency": "USD", "initial": 199, "final": 199, "discount_percent": 0, "initial_formatted": "", "final_formatted": "$1.99"}, "packages": [1504578], "package_groups": [{"name": "default", "title": "Buy Blockenstein", "description": "", "selection_text": "Select a purchase option", "save_text": "", "display_type": 0, "is_recurring_subscription": "false", "subs": [{"packageid": 1504578